# P44 (docs/RISK.md V351): Geant4 11.1.1 writes its physics tables in ASCII - the oracle of
# tests/test_lepton_lambda.cu (Lambda.eIoni.e-.asc, Lambda.eIoni.e+.asc, Lambda.eBrem.e-.asc,
# Lambda.eBrem.e+.asc). B1 as it ships (the couples G4_AIR, G4_WATER, G4_A-150_TISSUE,
# G4_BONE_COMPACT_ICRU), one event so the tables exist, then the store. Serial:
#   set G4FORCE_RUN_MANAGER_TYPE=Serial
#   ref\b1mat\run.bat <absolute path of this file>    (from the directory to hold g4tables\)
#   tests\test_lepton_lambda.exe g4tables     (or move g4tables\ to ref\oracle\g4tables\, the test's
#                                              default and what build_all's host-test list runs; gitignored)
/run/initialize
/run/particle/setStoredInAscii 1
/run/beamOn 1
/run/particle/storePhysicsTable g4tables
